# 🗺️ 3D Pune City AI Web App

A full-stack geospatial platform for exploring Pune city in 3D using **Leaflet + OSMBuildings**, **FastAPI**, **PostGIS**, and **Pelias**. Supports location search, historical insights, and AI-powered spatial queries like "nearest hospital" or "temple within 500m".

---

## 📁 Features

* 🌐 3D Map UI with Leaflet + OSMBuildings
* 🔍 Geocoder powered by **Pelias** with custom Pune data
* 📜 Historical info panel (Wikipedia + AI summaries)
* 🧠 AI assistant for spatial search queries (e.g., `nearest traffic choke point`, `temples in 1 km`, `history of Shaniwar Wada`)
* 📡 Map click support for querying **nearby amenities**
* 🛢️ Backend in **FastAPI** with spatial queries to **PostGIS**
* 📂 15+ GeoJSON layers: roads, transport, worship places, traffic, POIs, water, etc.

---

## 🚀 How to Run Locally

### 🔧 Requirements

* Docker & Docker Compose
* Git

### 📦 Clone and Set Up

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/3d-pune-city-ai-map.git
cd 3d-pune-city-ai-map
```

### 🐳 Start with Docker Compose

```bash
docker-compose up --build
```

This will start:

* PostgreSQL + PostGIS
* FastAPI backend
* Pelias geocoder (API, Elasticsearch, CSV Importer, Libpostal)

### 🌍 Open Frontend

Visit: `http://localhost:8000` to explore the 3D Pune city map.

