# 🏙️ AI-Powered 3D Geospatial Web Application for Urban Intelligence
## A Case Study of Pune City

[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)
[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-v3.8+-blue.svg)](https://www.python.org/downloads/)
[![FastAPI](https://img.shields.io/badge/FastAPI-0.68.0+-00a393.svg)](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/)
[![PostGIS](https://img.shields.io/badge/PostGIS-3.0+-336791.svg)](https://postgis.net/)

An interactive, AI-enhanced 3D geospatial web platform for urban spatial analysis and semantic querying in Pune City. This application integrates real-time spatial queries, natural language search, and 3D visualization to empower citizens, urban planners, tourists, and researchers with intelligent geospatial interactions.

![Application Architecture](architecture-diagram.png)

---

## 🎯 Project Objectives

This project aims to create a **digital twin of Pune City** with the following key capabilities:

- 🔍 **Spatial Search & Discovery** - Find nearby amenities and points of interest
- 🏛️ **Wikipedia-Powered Insights** - Historical context and location summaries from Wikipedia
- 🤖 **AI Integration** *(In Development)* - Natural language query processing using LLM models
- 🏗️ **3D Urban Visualization** - Interactive building models with shadow simulation
- 🔍 **Semantic Geocoding** - Custom-trained Pelias search engine for Pune-specific locations
- 🗺️ **Multi-modal Interaction** - Support for both text queries and map-click interactions

---

## ✨ Key Features

### 🔍 Intelligent Search & Discovery
- **Spatial Proximity Search**: Find nearby amenities using PostGIS spatial queries
- **Custom Geocoding**: Pelias-based search trained on Pune city data
- **Fuzzy Place Search**: Find locations even with partial or vernacular names
- **Interactive Map Queries**: Click anywhere to discover nearby points of interest

### 🌆 3D Visualization & Simulation
- **3D Buildings**: OSMBuildings integration with interactive lighting
- **Shadow Simulation**: Dynamic day/time visualization for urban planning
- **Multiple Basemaps**: OSM, CartoDB Light, ESRI Imagery, and more
- **Thematic Layers**: Traffic, transport, religious sites, water bodies

### 🏛️ Cultural & Historical Intelligence
- **Wikipedia Integration**: Automated historical information retrieval and display
- **Location Context**: Rich information panels for landmarks and heritage sites
- **Cultural Insights**: Special focus on places like Shaniwarwada, Dagdusheth Temple
- **Historical Summaries**: Structured presentation of place-specific information

### 🗺️ Advanced Spatial Analysis
- **PostGIS Spatial Queries**: ST_DWithin, ST_Distance, geodesic calculations
- **Real-time Proximity Analysis**: Click anywhere to find nearest amenities
- **Multi-layer Data Integration**: 15+ GeoJSON layers from PMC Datastore

### 🚧 In Development
- **Natural Language Processing**: AI-powered query interpretation using LLM models
- **Conversational Interface**: ChatGPT integration for intelligent spatial queries
- **Smart Recommendations**: AI-generated suggestions based on user context

---

## 🛠️ Technology Stack

### Frontend
- **Leaflet.js** - Interactive mapping framework
- **OSMBuildings** - 3D building visualization
- **JavaScript/HTML/CSS** - UI and interactions

### Backend
- **FastAPI** - High-performance Python web framework
- **SQLAlchemy** - ORM for database operations
- **PostGIS** - Spatial database on Docker
- **Wikipedia API** - Historical and cultural information retrieval
- **BeautifulSoup** - Web scraping for content extraction
- **OpenAI GPT** *(In Development)* - AI-powered query understanding

### Geocoding & Search
- **Pelias** - Custom geocoder with CSV importer
- **Docker** - Containerized deployment
- **Pune-specific training data** - Enhanced local search accuracy

### Data Sources
- **PMC Datastore** - 15+ GeoJSON layers (roads, traffic, transport, POIs)
- **OpenStreetMap** - Building footprints and street data
- **WhosOnFirst** - Administrative boundaries
- **Wikipedia API** - Historical and cultural information

