## 🔧 Configuration

### Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file in the backend directory:

```env
# Database Configuration
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:admin@localhost:5432/pune_gis
POSTGRES_HOST=localhost
POSTGRES_PORT=5432
POSTGRES_DB=pune_gis
POSTGRES_USER=postgres
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=admin

# AI Integration (Future)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-3.5-turbo

# Wikipedia Integration (Current)
WIKIPEDIA_API_URL=https://en.wikipedia.org/api/rest_v1
WIKIPEDIA_LANGUAGE=en

# External Services
PELIAS_URL=http://localhost:4000
WIKIPEDIA_API_URL=https://en.wikipedia.org/api/rest_v1

# Application Settings
DEBUG=True
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:3000", "http://127.0.0.1:3000"]
```

### Database Configuration

The application uses PostGIS for spatial operations. Key spatial functions utilized:

```sql
-- Distance calculations
ST_DWithin(point1, point2, distance_meters)

-- Nearest neighbor queries
ST_Distance(geometry1, geometry2)

-- GeoJSON output
ST_AsGeoJSON(geometry)

-- Spatial indexing
CREATE INDEX idx_buildings_geom ON buildings USING GIST(geom);
```

