## 🎮 Usage Examples

### Current Features (Implemented)

```javascript
// Location search using Pelias geocoder
searchLocation("Fergusson College");

// Find nearby amenities using spatial queries
findNearby(lat, lon, "temple", 500); // 500m radius

// Get historical information from Wikipedia
getLocationHistory("Shaniwarwada");
```

### Planned Features (In Development)

```javascript
// Natural language queries (coming soon)
"Find temples near Fergusson College"
"Show me hospitals within 1 km of Shaniwarwada" 
"Bus stops around Pune University"
"Restaurants near MG Road"
```

### API Endpoints (Current Implementation)

```bash
# Search locations using Pelias
GET /api/search?q=Fergusson%20College

# Find nearby amenities (implemented)
GET /api/nearby?lat=18.5204&lon=73.8567&type=temple&radius=500

# Get historical information from Wikipedia (implemented) 
GET /api/history?place=Shaniwarwada

# 3D building data
GET /api/buildings?bbox=73.8567,18.5204,73.8667,18.5304
```

### Future API Endpoints (In Development)

```bash
# Natural language query processing (planned)
POST /api/chat
{
  "query": "Find temples near Fergusson College",
  "context": {"lat": 18.5204, "lon": 73.8567}
}
```

### Map Interactions

1. **Search Box**: Type any location name or address
2. **Click Query**: Click anywhere on the map to find nearby amenities
3. **Layer Toggle**: Switch between different map layers
4. **3D Controls**: Adjust building height and lighting
5. **Time Slider**: Simulate shadows at different times of day

