## 🔬 Technical Innovations

### ✅ Implemented Features

#### Spatial Proximity Analysis
Advanced PostGIS spatial queries for real-time nearby amenity discovery with distance calculations and filtering.

#### Custom Geocoder Integration  
Pelias geocoder specifically trained on Pune city data for enhanced local search accuracy and vernacular name support.

#### 3D Urban Visualization
Real-time 3D building rendering with dynamic lighting and shadow simulation using OSMBuildings.

#### Wikipedia-Powered Cultural Insights
Automated scraping and structured presentation of historical context and cultural information for landmarks.

#### Multi-modal Spatial Interaction
Support for both text-based location search and map-click spatial analysis with contextual results.

### 🚧 In Development

#### Semantic Spatial Search
Integration of LLM models (ChatGPT/OpenAI) for parsing natural language queries and converting them to spatial SQL operations.

#### Conversational GIS Interface
AI-powered chatbot capable of understanding complex spatial relationships and providing intelligent recommendations.

#### Context-Aware Recommendations
Machine learning integration for personalized location suggestions based on user behavior and preferences.

