## 🗂️ Data Layers

The application integrates multiple geospatial datasets:

| Layer Type | Source | Features | Use Case |
|------------|--------|----------|----------|
| Buildings | PMC Datastore | 50,000+ footprints | 3D visualization, shadow analysis |
| Roads | OpenStreetMap | Street network | Navigation, accessibility |
| Traffic | PMC Traffic Dept | Traffic density | Urban planning |
| Transport | PMPML | Bus stops, routes | Public transport |
| Religious Sites | Community data | Temples, churches | Cultural mapping |
| Healthcare | PMC Health | Hospitals, clinics | Emergency services |
| Water Bodies | Survey of India | Rivers, lakes | Environmental analysis |
| Administrative | WhosOnFirst | Ward boundaries | Governance |

